  "highlights": [],
  "overviewHtml": "<div> <div><p>Nepal Unique Treks offers the Nepal Tours Package, it is the best reason to visit and explore the Himalayan country and friendly Nepali people which will give you an awesome experience and a memorable journey in your lifetime. The specific program schedule allows visitors to explore Nepali culture, religion, and tradition.</p><p>An exclusive cultural heritage with an unbelievable history. Nepal is one of the best destinations for holidays. During your stay here on special tours in Nepal you will learn the various cultural, traditional, and religious aspects of the people.</p><p>Especially Hindu and Buddhist Nepali communities. There are wonderful Himalayas, snow cap hills, and lovely natural vegetation welcoming you into the small nature paradise of Nepal</p><p>We like to do all the programming within in short time including small trekking in the hills. Appearing suitable for the aged and pleasure-wanted visitors too. We love to give special prices for this tour. 20 % of our package cost except transportation and permit can be reduced. The best time special Tour in Nepal.</p><p>The tour package is beginning of March to the end of May and the beginning of September to the end of December. You can choose the details of itineraries as per your desire and holidays for a special tour in Nepal.</p><p>Besides cultural tours in Nepal, you can enjoy adventure holidays in Nepal such as bungee jumping in Nepal, zip flying in Nepal, sky diving in Nepal, paragliding in Nepal, etc.</p><h2> </h2></div></div>",
  "overviewPlainWordCount": 242,
